// SIMPLE FOREST ENCOUNTER
// ------------------------------------------------------------

== forest_simple

You venture into the dense forest. The trees tower above you, and the path ahead is uncertain.

* Continue deeper into the forest
    You push forward through the thick undergrowth.
    The forest grows darker and more mysterious.
    -> END

* Follow the stream
    You discover a small crystal stream.
    The water looks pure and refreshing.
    -> END

* Turn back
    You decide this forest is too dangerous.
    Sometimes discretion is the better part of valor.
    -> END
